Rule 1 (input must have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 3 (negative dim maps to a valid non-negative index)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then 0 ≤ v_2 + ndim(v_1) ∧ v_2 + ndim(v_1) ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
>>
Rule 5 (dim within valid range [-ndim(input), ndim(input) - 1])
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= 0 - ndim(v_1) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
